Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Dither Studio does not vendor EdgeTAM. setup.sh clones it into env/EdgeTAM at a
pinned commit and patches two `.view(...)` calls to `.reshape(...)` in
sam2/modeling/perceiver.py so that more than one object can be tracked at once.

The EdgeTAM checkpoint (edgetam.pt) is downloaded from
https://huggingface.co/spaces/facebook/EdgeTAM and is likewise Apache-2.0. It is
not committed to this repository. The ONNX graphs under web/models/ and the
CoreML packages under env/coreml/ are derived from that checkpoint and carry the
same licence; they are also not committed.

EdgeTAM builds on SAM 2 (https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2), also
Apache-2.0, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.

